{"limitations":["Read-only review of the supplied packet only. No files changed and no tests, typecheck, build, or runtime/provider check was run.","Exact behaviour of parse5 in the no-body and multi-text-node cases was reasoned from source, not executed.","lib/exact-copy-evidence.ts, lib/business-checks.ts, lib/contracts.ts, and lib/assessment-risk-fields.ts were not in the packet, so hasUncertainSourceBodyCopyAtFile, getBusinessCheckPlan, the ProofBusinessExpected shapes, and canonicalAssessmentRisk were not verified.","The interim-independent-whole-answer-review.json output referenced at citation-relations-interim-feedback.json line 3 was not supplied, so the all11/11 versus all4 claim could only be checked against the feedback summary text, not the raw answers.","No evidence is supplied for PHAROS_INC August 1st deterministic rules or AgentReceipt August Most Innovative, so no award comparison or superiority judgment was made.","The readability 567/370 versus 600 claim cannot be checked because the prior text is not in the packet. I make no claim about it.","The prompt changes' effect on the sealed2repos and known7 reruns is unverified pending the final freeze run."]}
